erve-wracking to me because yeah like i  said that's that's what we usually do if  you're well prepared  you're okay that's a very good point as  long as you if you've done your homework  then you can sit back and you can enjoy  it somewhat you know but uh  the real real nerves come and you can  see it in people's eyes when they  haven't done their homework then then  you can be in real trouble because  there's a lot of eyes  on you  one of the things about this is that  normally i'm talking to people and i say  oh i love season one i can't i hope you  guys get to make a season two you've  already filmed season two  which is amazing i love it so um  obviously a lot of people are gonna  watch the first eight episodes in a day  and they're gonna wonder what's next so  can you tease anything about season two  well i can promise you it's going to be  a forward and upwards trajectory story  wise  i mean again getting the scripts you  think i mean i don't i don't have  imagination for what they're writing so  i'm continually amazed every time i get  the new scripts  and seeing season two uh i mean i was  just i was ecstatic it's  it's so good  so i can promise you more that's what i  can promise you yeah and like vikings do  not take a backwards step  they do not i love learning about the  behind the scenes for the making of a  show so for soon to be fans is there  anything you think that might surprise  them to learn about the actual making of  vikings valhalla well maybe  like this big set piece in episode four  you might be surprised to know that i  never saw the bridge at all until i saw  it on tv because all of my bits on the  boat were filmed on a lake with with  nothing in front of us  and i know the bridge was in four pieces  and bradley you never saw us on the  boats  no we um we filmed the majority of of  the actual bridge  in the field or on the backlots so and  the bits taking place under the bridge  that's also on different locations  so the composition it looks seamless but  you might be surprised at just how  dispersed it really is  to the extent where i've never even seen  the bridge with my own eyes it looks so  good um i already got to stop i'm just  going to say congratulations on the show  i wish you guys nothing but the best and  i hope i get to talk to you for season  two and three and beyond  thank you steve thank you so much  you
 

